  <Settings>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a4621c90bf8b4fb4f8d530d842f8c4a0, type: 2}
  description: Convoys run the lagoon between the reefs, destroyers escorting fat transports. Take their cargo and storm the Reef Bastion.
  introduces: 'Convoys: transports under destroyer escort. The Reef Bastion''s towers shell the whole lagoon.'
  hints:
  - A transport always drops what it carries.
  - The bastion's keep opens when its towers and guns are gone.
